{"step_index":1157,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-28T23:31:11Z","thinking":"**Initiating Validation Process**\n\nI'm now putting the rubber to the road! My focus is to execute the audit and validation procedures as recommended. I've initiated creation of a Python script, named `ops/training/validate_dpo_corpora.py`. This script will freeze the 927 DPO pairs and then implement the validation pass, randomly sampling 50 DPO pairs from the data for verification.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"\nSOVRA SYNTHETIC DPO CORPORA VALIDATION PASS\nAudits synthetic DPO pairs to prevent mode collapse, echo chamber distortion, and compounding distillation errors.\n\"\"\"\n\nimport json\nimport os\nimport random\nimport sys\n\nCORPORA_DIR = \"/Volumes/Untitled/SSOT_Agentic_Brain_v1.1.0_ENGINEERING_RELEASE/data_center/synthetic_training\"\nDPO_FILE = os.path.join(CORPORA_DIR, \"dpo_distilled_corpora.json\")\nREPORT_OUTPUT = \"/Volumes/Untitled/SSOT_Agentic_Brain_v1.1.0_ENGINEERING_RELEASE/memory/agent_logs/dpo_validation_report.json\"\n\ndef run_dpo_audit(sample_size=50):\n    if not os.path.exists(DPO_FILE):\n        print(f\"[AUDIT-ERROR] DPO File missing: {DPO_FILE}\")\n        return False, 0.0\n\n    with open(DPO_FILE, \"r\") as f:\n        data = json.load(f)\n\n    total_pairs = len(data)\n    if total_pairs == 0:\n        print(\"[AUDIT-ERROR] DPO File is empty.\")\n        return False, 0.0\n\n    print(f\"[*] Auditing DPO Dataset: Total Pairs = {total_pairs}\")\n    \n    # Deterministic seed for reproducible validation\n    random.seed(42)\n    sampled_indices = random.sample(range(total_pairs), min(sample_size, total_pairs))\n    \n    valid_count = 0\n    issues = []\n\n    for idx in sampled_indices:\n        item = data[idx]\n        chosen = item.get(\"chosen\", \"\")\n        rejected = item.get(\"rejected\", \"\")\n        prompt = item.get(\"prompt\", \"\")\n\n        # Quality Criteria 1: Non-empty strings\n        if not prompt or not chosen or not rejected:\n            issues.append(f\"Pair {idx}: Empty fields detected\")\n            continue\n\n        # Quality Criteria 2: Distinct chosen vs rejected\n        if chosen == rejected:\n            issues.append(f\"Pair {idx}: Chosen and Rejected are identical (Mode Collapse)\")\n            continue\n\n        # Quality Criteria 3: Length & Structural Disparity\n        if len(chosen) < 10 or len(rejected) < 5:\n            issues.append(f\"Pair {idx}: Trivial output length\")\n            continue\n\n        # Quality Criteria 4: Positive Quality Delta (Chosen has valid code/reasoning structure)\n        if \"error\" in chosen.lower() and \"error\" not in rejected.lower():\n            issues.append(f\"Pair {idx}: Chosen payload contains un-sanitized error state\")\n            continue\n\n        valid_count += 1\n\n    agreement_rate = (valid_count / len(sampled_indices)) * 100.0\n\n    report = {\n        \"total_dataset_size\": total_pairs,\n        \"sampled_pairs\": len(sampled_indices),\n        \"valid_pairs\": valid_count,\n        \"agreement_rate_pct\": round(agreement_rate, 2),\n        \"quality_gate_passed\": agreement_rate >= 80.0,\n        \"issues_detected\": issues\n    }\n\n    os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(REPORT_OUTPUT), exist_ok=True)\n    with open(REPORT_OUTPUT, \"w\") as f:\n        json.dump(report, f, indent=2)\n\n    print(f\"[AUDIT-RESULT] Sampled {len(sampled_indices)} pairs.\")\n    print(f\"[AUDIT-RESULT] Valid Pairs: {valid_count} / {len(sampled_indices)}\")\n    print(f\"[AUDIT-RESULT] Agreement Rate: {agreement_rate:.2f}%\")\n    print(f\"[AUDIT-RESULT] Quality Gate (>= 80%): {'PASSED' if agreement_rate >= 80 else 'FAILED'}\")\n    return report[\"quality_gate_passed\"], agreement_rate\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    passed, rate = run_dpo_audit(50)\n    sys.exit(0 if passed else 1)\n","Description":"Creating DPO corpora validation script to audit synthetic DPO training pairs","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"/Volumes/Untitled/SSOT_Agentic_Brain_v1.1.0_ENGINEERING_RELEASE/ops/training/validate_dpo_corpora.py","toolAction":"Writing DPO validation script","toolSummary":"Writing DPO validation script"}}]}
